<title>USA: General Housewares Corp Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>General Housewares Corp Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>TERRE HAUTE, Ind. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands of dollars except for per share amounts)</p>
<p>				     For the three     For the twelve</p>
<p>				     months ended	  months ended</p>
<p>						Dec 31,	  Dec 31,</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		     32,858   36,467   105,479  119,340</p>
